<p><strong>Procedure:</strong> The setup found in <span class="no">██</span>. <span class="no">██████</span>'<span class="no">█ ████████</span> was recreated. Several objects were placed nearby, along with <span class="no">███████</span> inside <span class="no">███ ███████</span>, with a range of <span class="no">█████ ███ ███████ ██████████</span>. For example, one such <span class="no">████</span> was a <span class="no">███ ██████ ████</span>, but another was a <span class="no">████ ██ ███████ ██████</span> in an <span class="no">██████</span> box. SCP-<span class="no">████</span> was <span class="no">█████████</span> under <span class="no">████████ █████████ ██████████ ██████████</span>.</p>
